---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const updatedAt = "August 2026";
---

<Layout
	title="Now | Udit Ramawat"
	description="A current snapshot of what Udit Ramawat is focused on, learning, building, and paying attention to."
>
	<section class="now-hero">
		<p class="eyebrow">Updated {updatedAt}</p>
		<h1>Now</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			A small public snapshot of what has my attention right now.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="now-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<Icon name="lucide:compass" aria-hidden="true" />
			<h2>Focused On</h2>
		</div>
		<ul class="now-list">
			<li>
				Leading technical programs for AI Products across research, application software, and hardware.
			</li>
			<li>
				Making model evaluation and MLOps workflows more repeatable, useful, and easy to operate.
			</li>
			<li>
				Improving developer experience so teams can move faster with less friction.
			</li>
			<li>
				Connecting requirements, dependencies, testing, schedules, and tradeoffs across the full product lifecycle.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="now-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<Icon name="lucide:hammer" aria-hidden="true" />
			<h2>Building</h2>
		</div>
		<ul class="now-list">
			<li>
				A calmer, more useful operating system for complex technical programs: clear plans, healthy release rhythms, and fewer stuck dependencies.
			</li>
			<li>
				I can’t share most project details, but my work spans AI research infrastructure, software applications, and hardware from prototype through validation.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="now-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<Icon name="lucide:book-open" aria-hidden="true" />
			<h2>Learning</h2>
		</div>
		<ul class="now-list">
			<li>More ASL practice.</li>
			<li>How to activate my core more often than I currently do.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="now-section">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<Icon name="lucide:mountain" aria-hidden="true" />
			<h2>Making Room For</h2>
		</div>
		<ul class="now-list">
			<li>Family bike rides.</li>
			<li>Coffee with Carly.</li>
			<li>Brunches with friends.</li>
			<li>Formula 1 weekends, especially when Ferrari gives me reasons to hope.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</Layout>
